  "prefLabel": "Agr 2101.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 2101.02 Scope. This chapter shall apply to all domestic animals proposed to be or actually imported into the state of New Hampshire, but only to the extent of determining the health of the domestic animals.\n\nSource. #4546, eff 12-16-88, EXPIRED 12-16-94\n\nNew. #6011, eff 3-28-95; ss by #6959, eff 3-23-99; ss by #8423, eff 8-31-05; ss by #8848, eff 3-21-07, EXPIRED: 3-21-15\n\nNew. #10975, eff 11-19-15; ss by #14564, eff 4-23-26, EXPIRES: 4-23-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr2100.html"
